# Graphify input scope for RocketForge (gitignore syntax).
#
# .gitignore is already honoured, so virtualenvs, build/, dist/, and the
# smoke/acceptance/packaged-selftest output never reach the graph. This file
# only drops *tracked* content that is noise for an architecture graph.

# One-off capture / soak / parity harnesses. They import the real stack but
# are not part of it; indexing them inflates hub counts and adds clusters for
# scripts that are run once and then kept only as evidence.
experiments/

# Agent tooling (skills, evals, a lint script) - not RocketForge architecture.
# CLAUDE.md names core symbols in backticks as examples; indexing it would add
# spurious doc->code edges to exactly the nodes impact queries start from.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Repository meta, community files, and issue/PR templates.
.github/
CHANGELOG.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE

# Binary assets and the packaging spec.
assets/
docs/images/
packaging/

